     "title": "The brief says push the merge of main first, then read MERGEABLE",
     "description": "(@nha, 2026-10-22: « make sure to not over-constrain but emphower them to do good work. ») outbound-gate read rule 7 as wait for MERGEABLE, yet a conflicting PR turns MERGEABLE only after its merge is pushed (2026-11-12).\n\n**Done when**\n\n1. [brief.rs](<http://brief.rs>) rule 7 says to push the merge of main, then read mergeable; a test reads the brief's text. 2. After merge: dash task brief <id> prints the new rule 7.\n\nsite_perso: `rust-brief-merge-push-order`",
